    {
      "id": 229063,
      "name": "Griff's Dad",
      "username": "Griff_s_Dad",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-29T12:43:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ouch. Mint, with everyone around&nbsp;5, which they dropped to quickly before things stabilized.</p>\n<p>Idealist brought out the Robot instead of the Floaty Head, which made it hard to contain the environment. What finally kept me from dying was a combination of Applied Numerology, StealthBot, and the Maze of Mirrors. All the environment cards that make you shoot yourself stopped hurting me and Maze of Mirrors&nbsp;kept most of Gloomy's stuff off of me. I finally did get Floaty Head out which let me kill the environment cards that did more damage.</p>\n<p>But while I was able to whittle Gloomweaver down slowly (since I could only hit him on a second hit after the mirrors redirected the first hit), I won because the environment (Carousel of Horror) eventually discarded all three of his relics into the trash. He had about 30 hp at the time.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:42.431Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
