    {
      "id": 229066,
      "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-29T15:40:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Near Mint after a close game, MMFFCC got too out of control the first game. I was just damage racing Gloom and had him down to 14 and 2 relics discarded via Carousel of Horror, but couldn't survive the damage being thrown around with Unstable Midway and You Won't Believe Your Eyes and Gone without a Trace.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Second game I focused on a slower, control the environment game and ended by beating Gloom down with everyone low teens and 2 relics in the trash. Getting the Cat instead of the Robot out first really helped.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>~Komori</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:42.641Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
