      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Near Mint after a close game, MMFFCC got too out of control the first game. I was just damage racing Gloom and had him down to 14 and 2 relics discarded via Carousel of Horror, but couldn't survive the damage being thrown around with Unstable Midway and You Won't Believe Your Eyes and Gone without a Trace.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Second game I focused on a slower, control the environment game and ended by beating Gloom down with everyone low teens and 2 relics in the trash. Getting the Cat instead of the Robot out first really helped.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>~Komori</p>",
