    {
      "id": 229067,
      "name": "Bigbywolfe",
      "username": "Bigbywolfe",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-29T17:43:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I screwed up royally but still got a Mint. Everyone dead but Benchmark. Freak Show prevented Benchmark from hurting anyone, including himself. Paired with self damage from the Environment and Maze of Mirrors redirecting damage to its source Gloomweaver and his minions beat themselves up for most of his health while I used Incap abilities to heal up Benchy and thin out the environment.</p>\n<p>Weird game. It felt like a very Setback way to win...</p>",
